@@ -1,3 +1,3 @@
-# Public local-only test fixture
+# Local-only TLS tests
 
-These self-signed certificate/key files are generated synthetic test data for 127.0.0.1 HTTPS regression tests. They are intentionally public, are not trusted production certificates, and must never be used on a real server. The Windows package excludes tests. Packaged Electron builds do not honor the development certificate pin.
